---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="Laundry Tips & Service Area Updates | Fresh Fold Delivery"
	description="Read Fresh Fold Delivery laundry tips, student laundry guides, commercial laundry advice, pricing explainers, and Central PA service-area updates."
	canonicalPath="/blog"
>
	<!-- Hero Section -->
	<section class="blog-hero">
		<div class="container">
			<h1>Fresh Fold Blog</h1>
			<p>Laundry tips, local insights, and updates from Fresh Fold Delivery. Helping you save time, look good, and enjoy more of what matters.</p>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Featured Post -->
	<section class="featured-post-section">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="featured-post">
				<div class="featured-image"></div>
				<div class="featured-content">
					<div class="badge">FEATURED</div>
					<h2>5 Laundry Habits That Save You Time (and Extend the Life of Your Clothes)</h2>
					<p>Simple changes to your routine can make a big difference. Here are our top tips from the laundry press.</p>
					<div class="post-meta">
						<span>👤 Fresh Fold Team</span>
						<span>📅 May 6, 2025</span>
					</div>
					<a href="#" class="btn btn-primary">Read Full Article</a>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Search and Filter -->
	<section class="blog-controls">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="search-bar">
				<input type="text" placeholder="Search articles..." />
				<button class="search-btn">🔍</button>
			</div>
			<div class="filters">
				<button class="filter-btn active">All Articles</button>
				<button class="filter-btn">Laundry Tips</button>
				<button class="filter-btn">Altoona Laundry</button>
				<button class="filter-btn">State College Student Laundry</button>
				<button class="filter-btn">Commercial Laundry</button>
				<button class="filter-btn">Airbnb Laundry</button>
				<button class="filter-btn">Subscriptions & Savings</button>
				<button class="filter-btn">Fresh Fold Updates</button>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Blog Grid -->
	<section class="blog-grid-section">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="blog-grid">
				<!-- Post 1 -->
				<article class="blog-post">
					<div class="post-image"></div>
					<div class="post-badge">LAUNDRY TIPS</div>
					<h3>How Often Should You Wash Your Sheets?</h3>
					<p>Find out the ideal washing frequency for your sheets. Here are our top tips from the laundry press.</p>
					<div class="post-footer">
						<div class="author">
							<span class="avatar">👤</span>
							<div>
								<strong>Fresh Fold Team</strong>
								<span class="date">May 4, 2025</span>
							</div>
						</div>
						<a href="#" class="read-more">Read More →</a>
					</div>
				</article>

				<!-- Post 2 -->
				<article class="blog-post">
					<div class="post-image"></div>
					<div class="post-badge state-college">STATE COLLEGE STUDENT LAUNDRY</div>
					<h3>Move-Out Laundry Made Easy</h3>
					<p>Your end-of-semester checklist to be stressful. Here's an idea to make laundry move-out easy.</p>
					<div class="post-footer">
						<div class="author">
							<span class="avatar">👤</span>
							<div>
								<strong>Fresh Fold Team</strong>
								<span class="date">May 1, 2025</span>
							</div>
						</div>
						<a href="#" class="read-more">Read More →</a>
					</div>
				</article>

				<!-- Post 3 -->
				<article class="blog-post">
					<div class="post-image"></div>
					<div class="post-badge altoona">ALTOONA LAUNDRY</div>
					<h3>Supporting Local: Why We Love Altoona</h3>
					<p>We're proud to be part of the Altoona community and we're the secret to 5-star guest service.</p>
					<div class="post-footer">
						<div class="author">
							<span class="avatar">👤</span>
							<div>
								<strong>Fresh Fold Team</strong>
								<span class="date">Apr 28, 2025</span>
							</div>
						</div>
						<a href="#" class="read-more">Read More →</a>
					</div>
				</article>

				<!-- Post 4 -->
				<article class="blog-post">
					<div class="post-image"></div>
					<div class="post-badge subscriptions">SUBSCRIPTIONS & SAVINGS</div>
					<h3>Subscription vs. Pay-Per-Order</h3>
					<p>Which plan works best? Compare the benefits and find your perfect fit.</p>
					<div class="post-footer">
						<div class="author">
							<span class="avatar">👤</span>
							<div>
								<strong>Fresh Fold Team</strong>
								<span class="date">Apr 25, 2025</span>
							</div>
						</div>
						<a href="#" class="read-more">Read More →</a>
					</div>
				</article>

				<!-- Post 5 -->
				<article class="blog-post">
					<div class="post-image"></div>
					<div class="post-badge commercial">COMMERCIAL LAUNDRY</div>
					<h3>Clean Linens, Happy Customers</h3>
					<p>Your local laundry service makes all the difference. Why local laundry benefits our businesses.</p>
					<div class="post-footer">
						<div class="author">
							<span class="avatar">👤</span>
							<div>
								<strong>Fresh Fold Team</strong>
								<span class="date">Apr 22, 2025</span>
							</div>
						</div>
						<a href="#" class="read-more">Read More →</a>
					</div>
				</article>

				<!-- Post 6 -->
				<article class="blog-post">
					<div class="post-image"></div>
					<div class="post-badge airbnb">AIRBNB LAUNDRY</div>
					<h3>Small Touches That Delight Guests</h3>
					<p>Fresh linens are the secret to 5-star Airbnb hosting. They're the secret to 5-star guest satisfaction.</p>
					<div class="post-footer">
						<div class="author">
							<span class="avatar">👤</span>
							<div>
								<strong>Fresh Fold Team</strong>
								<span class="date">Apr 19, 2025</span>
							</div>
						</div>
						<a href="#" class="read-more">Read More →</a>
					</div>
				</article>

				<!-- Post 7 -->
				<article class="blog-post">
					<div class="post-image"></div>
					<div class="post-badge">FRESH FOLD UPDATES</div>
					<h3>We've Expanded Our Pickup Routes!</h3>
					<p>More neighborhoods, same reliable service. We're excited to announce new service in the month.</p>
					<div class="post-footer">
						<div class="author">
							<span class="avatar">👤</span>
							<div>
								<strong>Fresh Fold Team</strong>
								<span class="date">May 5, 2025</span>
							</div>
						</div>
						<a href="#" class="read-more">Read More →</a>
					</div>
				</article>

				<!-- Post 8 -->
				<article class="blog-post">
					<div class="post-image"></div>
					<div class="post-badge laundry-tips">LAUNDRY TIPS</div>
					<h3>Stain Removal Cheat Sheet</h3>
					<p>Quick tips for tackling those tricky stain at home.</p>
					<div class="post-footer">
						<div class="author">
							<span class="avatar">👤</span>
							<div>
								<strong>Fresh Fold Team</strong>
								<span class="date">Feb 21, 2025</span>
							</div>
						</div>
						<a href="#" class="read-more">Read More →</a>
					</div>
				</article>

				<!-- Post 9 -->
				<article class="blog-post">
					<div class="post-image"></div>
					<div class="post-badge state-college">STATE COLLEGE STUDENT LAUNDRY</div>
					<h3>Laundry on a Budget: Student Edition</h3>
					<p>Smart ways to save time and money all semester long.</p>
					<div class="post-footer">
						<div class="author">
							<span class="avatar">👤</span>
							<div>
								<strong>Fresh Fold Team</strong>
								<span class="date">Feb 14, 2025</span>
							</div>
						</div>
						<a href="#" class="read-more">Read More →</a>
					</div>
				</article>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Popular Posts Sidebar -->
	<section class="popular-posts-section">
		<div class="container">
			<h2>Popular Posts</h2>
			<div class="popular-grid">
				<article class="popular-post">
					<div class="popular-image"></div>
					<h4>How to Prep Laundry for Pickup Service</h4>
					<span class="date">Apr 22, 2025</span>
				</article>
				<article class="popular-post">
					<div class="popular-image"></div>
					<h4>State College Student Laundry: Save Time, Study More</h4>
					<span class="date">Apr 8, 2025</span>
				</article>
				<article class="popular-post">
					<div class="popular-image"></div>
					<h4>What We Don't Clean (and Why)</h4>
					<span class="date">Mar 25, 2025</span>
				</article>
				<article class="popular-post">
					<div class="popular-image"></div>
					<h4>Airbnb Laundry Checklist for 5-Star Hosts</h4>
					<span class="date">Mar 12, 2025</span>
				</article>
				<article class="popular-post">
					<div class="popular-image"></div>
					<h4>The Best Fabrics for Busy Lifestyles</h4>
					<span class="date">Feb 28, 2025</span>
				</article>
			</div>
			<div class="view-all-link">
				<a href="#">View all articles →</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Topics -->
	<section class="topics-section">
		<div class="container">
			<h2>Topics at a Glance</h2>
			<div class="topics-grid">
				<div class="topic">
					<h4>Laundry Tips</h4>
					<span class="count">18</span>
				</div>
				<div class="topic">
					<h4>Altoona Laundry</h4>
					<span class="count">12</span>
				</div>
				<div class="topic">
					<h4>State College Student Laundry</h4>
					<span class="count">10</span>
				</div>
				<div class="topic">
					<h4>Commercial Laundry</h4>
					<span class="count">8</span>
				</div>
				<div class="topic">
					<h4>Airbnb Laundry</h4>
					<span class="count">7</span>
				</div>
				<div class="topic">
					<h4>Subscriptions & Savings</h4>
					<span class="count">6</span>
				</div>
				<div class="topic">
					<h4>Fresh Fold Updates</h4>
					<span class="count">11</span>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>

<style>
	.blog-hero {
		background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f0f4f8 0%, #e8f2f8 100%);
		padding: 60px 0;
		text-align: center;
	}

	.blog-hero h1 {
		color: #001f3f;
		margin-bottom: 15px;
	}

	.blog-hero p {
		color: #666;
		font-size: 1.1rem;
		max-width: 600px;
		margin: 0 auto;
	}

	.featured-post-section {
		padding: 60px 0;
	}

	.featured-post {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
		gap: 40px;
		align-items: center;
		background: white;
		padding: 40px;
		border-radius: 8px;
		box-shadow: 0 5px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
	}

	.featured-image {
		width: 100%;
		aspect-ratio: 1;
		background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e8f2f8 0%, #d4e6f1 100%);
		border-radius: 8px;
	}

	.featured-content {
		position: relative;
	}

	.featured-content .badge {
		display: inline-block;
		background-color: #0066a1;
		color: white;
		padding: 6px 12px;
		border-radius: 4px;
		font-size: 0.75rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		margin-bottom: 15px;
	}

	.featured-content h2 {
		color: #001f3f;
		margin-bottom: 15px;
	}

	.featured-content p {
		color: #666;
		margin-bottom: 20px;
		line-height: 1.8;
	}

	.post-meta {
		display: flex;
		gap: 20px;
		margin-bottom: 20px;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		color: #999;
	}

	.blog-controls {
		background-color: #f9f9f9;
		padding: 40px 0;
	}

	.search-bar {
		display: flex;
		margin-bottom: 30px;
		background: white;
		border-radius: 6px;
		overflow: hidden;
		border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
	}

	.search-bar input {
		flex: 1;
		padding: 12px 15px;
		border: none;
		font-size: 1rem;
	}

	.search-btn {
		padding: 12px 20px;
		background: white;
		border: none;
		cursor: pointer;
		font-size: 1.2rem;
	}

	.filters {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 10px;
	}

	.filter-btn {
		padding: 8px 16px;
		background: white;
		border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
		border-radius: 20px;
		cursor: pointer;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		transition: all 0.3s;
	}

	.filter-btn:hover,
	.filter-btn.active {
		background-color: #0066a1;
		color: white;
		border-color: #0066a1;
	}

	.blog-grid-section {
		padding: 40px 0;
	}

	.blog-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(300px, 1fr));
		gap: 30px;
	}

	.blog-post {
		background: white;
		border-radius: 8px;
		overflow: hidden;
		box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
		transition: all 0.3s;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
	}

	.blog-post:hover {
		transform: translateY(-5px);
		box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
	}

	.post-image {
		width: 100%;
		height: 200px;
		background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e8f2f8 0%, #d4e6f1 100%);
		position: relative;
	}

	.post-badge {
		position: absolute;
		top: 10px;
		left: 10px;
		background-color: #0066a1;
		color: white;
		padding: 6px 12px;
		border-radius: 4px;
		font-size: 0.75rem;
		font-weight: 700;
	}

	.post-badge.state-college {
		background-color: #00a0c6;
	}

	.post-badge.altoona {
		background-color: #0066a1;
	}

	.post-badge.subscriptions {
		background-color: #00a0c6;
	}

	.post-badge.commercial {
		background-color: #0066a1;
	}

	.post-badge.airbnb {
		background-color: #00a0c6;
	}

	.post-badge.laundry-tips {
		background-color: #0066a1;
	}

	.blog-post h3 {
		padding: 20px 20px 10px;
		color: #001f3f;
		font-size: 1.1rem;
		flex-grow: 1;
	}

	.blog-post p {
		padding: 0 20px 15px;
		color: #666;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
	}

	.post-footer {
		padding: 0 20px 20px;
		border-top: 1px solid #f0f0f0;
		padding-top: 15px;
		margin-top: auto;
	}

	.author {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 10px;
		margin-bottom: 10px;
	}

	.avatar {
		font-size: 1.5rem;
	}

	.author strong {
		display: block;
		color: #333;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
	}

	.author .date {
		color: #999;
		font-size: 0.8rem;
	}

	.read-more {
		display: inline-block;
		color: #00a0c6;
		text-decoration: none;
		font-weight: 600;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		transition: color 0.3s;
	}

	.read-more:hover {
		color: #0066a1;
	}

	.popular-posts-section {
		background-color: #f9f9f9;
		padding: 60px 0;
	}

	.popular-posts-section h2 {
		color: #001f3f;
		margin-bottom: 30px;
	}

	.popular-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
		gap: 20px;
		margin-bottom: 30px;
	}

	.popular-post {
		background: white;
		border-radius: 8px;
		overflow: hidden;
		display: flex;
		gap: 15px;
	}

	.popular-image {
		width: 100px;
		height: 100px;
		background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e8f2f8 0%, #d4e6f1 100%);
		flex-shrink: 0;
	}

	.popular-post h4 {
		padding: 15px 15px 0 0;
		color: #001f3f;
		font-size: 1rem;
	}

	.popular-post .date {
		display: block;
		padding: 0 15px 15px 0;
		color: #999;
		font-size: 0.8rem;
	}

	.view-all-link {
		text-align: center;
	}

	.view-all-link a {
		color: #00a0c6;
		text-decoration: none;
		font-weight: 600;
		transition: color 0.3s;
	}

	.view-all-link a:hover {
		color: #0066a1;
	}

	.topics-section {
		padding: 60px 0;
	}

	.topics-section h2 {
		color: #001f3f;
		margin-bottom: 30px;
	}

	.topics-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr));
		gap: 20px;
	}

	.topic {
		background: white;
		padding: 20px;
		border-radius: 8px;
		border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
		display: flex;
		justify-content: space-between;
		align-items: center;
	}

	.topic h4 {
		color: #001f3f;
		margin: 0;
		font-size: 0.95rem;
	}

	.topic .count {
		background-color: #00a0c6;
		color: white;
		padding: 4px 10px;
		border-radius: 20px;
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		font-weight: 600;
	}

	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		.featured-post {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			gap: 20px;
		}

		.blog-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}

		.blog-hero h1 {
			font-size: 1.8rem;
		}

		.filters {
			gap: 8px;
		}

		.filter-btn {
			padding: 6px 12px;
			font-size: 0.8rem;
		}
	}
</style>
